### Problem 3: Pass or fail (pass mark = 50)

**Pseudocode**
```text
START
    INPUT score
    IF score < 0 OR score > 100 THEN
        OUTPUT "Invalid score"
    ELSE IF score >= 50 THEN
        OUTPUT "Pass"
    ELSE
        OUTPUT "Fail"
    END IF
STOP
```

**Flowchart**
```text
             (START)
                |
          / Input score /
                |
        < score < 0 OR > 100? >
          Yes /             \\ No
             /               \\
 / Display "Invalid score" /  < score >= 50? >
             |                Yes /       \\ No
           (STOP)       / Display Pass /  / Display Fail /
                               \\           /
                                  (STOP)
```

### Problem 4: Largest of three numbers

**Pseudocode**
```text
START
    INPUT A, B, C
    IF A >= B AND A >= C THEN
        largest = A
    ELSE IF B >= A AND B >= C THEN
        largest = B
    ELSE
        largest = C
    END IF
    OUTPUT largest
STOP
```

**Flowchart**
```text
 (START)
    |
 / Input A, B, C /
    |
 < A >= B AND A >= C? >
   Yes /              \\ No
      /                \\
[largest = A]     < B >= A AND B >= C? >
                    Yes /           \\ No
                       /             \\
               [largest = B]   [largest = C]
                       \\             /
                       / Display largest /
                               |
                            (STOP)
```

